+			/* verifierloop: PRINT-ONLY prune-pair instrumentation, 2023-06 ERA (fourth variant).
+			 *
+			 * Fourth variant, ported from the 2021 one for H21 (1ffc85d9298e).
+			 * This revision has NO exact_level, no cnum, no delta/BPF_ADD_CONST;
+			 * regsafe's scalar arm: REG_LIVE_READ gate, regs_exact fast path, a
+			 * ONE-SIDED precision short-circuit (!rold->precise), then
+			 * range_within && tnum_in. Same print format as 2021 -- the fields
+			 * are identical -- so ROW_21 parses it; live= is the era marker.
+			 * Hooked at the `hit:' label so the iterator goto-hit path is
